1","VerseNumber":25,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"مِّمَّا خَطِيٓـَٰٔتِهِمۡ أُغۡرِقُواْ فَأُدۡخِلُواْ نَارٗا فَلَمۡ يَجِدُواْ لَهُم مِّن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ أَنصَارٗا","TajweedText":"مِّ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا خَط<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِيٓ</tajweed>ـَٔ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تِهِمْ أُغْرِقُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> فَأُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>خِلُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> نَا<tajweed class=ikhafa>رًا ف</tajweed>َلَمْ يَجِدُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> لَه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن د</tajweed>ُونِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نص</tajweed>َارًا <span class=end>٢٥</span>","End":"٢٥","PageNumber":571,"JuzNumber":29,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":505,"MaqraNumber":228,"HizbNumber":57,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":71,"SurahIndex":"071","VerseNumber":26,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَقَالَ نُوحٞ رَّبِّ لَا تَذَرۡ عَلَى ٱلۡأَرۡضِ مِنَ ٱلۡكَٰفِرِينَ دَيَّارًا","TajweedText":"وَقَالَ نُو<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>حٌ ر</tajweed>َّبِّ لَا تَذَرْ عَلَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْكَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>فِرِينَ دَيَّارًا <span class=end>٢٦</span>","End":"٢٦","PageNumber":571,"JuzNumber":29,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":505,"MaqraNumber":228,"HizbNumber":57,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":71,"SurahIndex":"071","VerseNumber":27,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّكَ إِن تَذَرۡهُمۡ يُضِلُّواْ عِبَادَكَ وَلَا يَلِدُوٓاْ إِلَّا فَاجِرٗا كَفَّارٗا","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكَ إِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ت</tajweed>َذَرْهُمْ يُضِلُّو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> عِبَادَكَ وَلَا يَلِد<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> إِلَّا فَاجِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>رًا ك</tajweed>َفَّارًا <span class=en